---
import Frame from '../../components/eq/Frame.astro';
import { data } from '../../data/eq-data';
---
<Frame title="About EQ Lab"><h1>About EQ Lab</h1><p class="notice">Independent results. EQ Lab is not affiliated with or endorsed by EQ-Bench. Its ratings are not EQ-Bench scores.</p><section class="panel"><h2>How it works</h2><p>A tested model holds an eight-turn conversation with a simulated person. Judges compare two models on the same persona in both orders, across six dimensions. The partner is {data.partner}. Both judges use subscriptions: Claude Code Opus 5.5 low and Codex GPT-6.1 Sol low.</p><p>The plan covers {data.personas} personas. Ratings use the upstream soft Bradley–Terry solver. When at least two anchors are rated, a least-squares fit maps the ratings to the EQ-Bench scale. Intervals are bootstrapped; abilities are relative to the models in this run.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Differences from upstream</h2><ul>{data.deviations.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul></section><section class="panel"><h2>Attribution and licence</h2><p>Uses <a href={data.upstream.url}>EQ-Bench 4</a>, commit {data.upstream.commit}, dataset v0.17. Licence: {data.upstream.license}.</p></section></Frame>
